{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/warpdotdev/warp/pulls/9415","id":3602459352,"node_id":"PR_kwDOFua7Vs7WuSrY","html_url":"https://github.com/warpdotdev/warp/pull/9415","diff_url":"https://github.com/warpdotdev/warp/pull/9415.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/warpdotdev/warp/pull/9415.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/warpdotdev/warp/issues/9415","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/warpdotdev/warp/pulls/9415/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/warpdotdev/warp/pulls/9415/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/warpdotdev/warp/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/warpdotdev/warp/issues/9415/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/warpdotdev/warp/statuses/fa7dd14086ed18a16799b797a67cbdec02a5a417","number":9415,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add change-keybinding bundled skill for Agent Mode","user":{"login":"sebryu","id":6872083,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4NzIwODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6872083?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebryu","html_url":"https://github.com/sebryu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebryu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebryu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebryu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebryu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebryu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebryu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebryu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebryu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebryu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Description\n\nAdds a new bundled skill at \\`resources/bundled/skills/change-keybinding/\\` that teaches Warp's Agent Mode how to remap keyboard shortcuts when the user asks (e.g. _\"Please change ctrl+space mapping to ctrl+s\"_).\n\nThe skill walks the agent through:\n- Discovering the right \\`~/.warp*/keybindings.yaml\\` file (channel-aware via \\`ls -d ~/.warp*/\\`).\n- The YAML format, including the **mandatory quoting** of action names that contain \\`:\\`.\n- Keystroke encoding: modifier order, the **uppercase-after-shift** rule, special key names, multi-keystroke chords (space-separated), and the \\`none\\` removal sentinel.\n- The discoverability gap — defaults are compiled into Rust and not introspectable from disk, so the agent must \\`ask_user_question\\` rather than guess when it can't find the binding in the user's yaml.\n- The fact that \\`keybindings.yaml\\` is read only at app launch (via \\`load_custom_keybindings\\` in \\`app/src/lib.rs\\`), so the user must restart Warp.\n\nNo Rust changes are needed: \\`SkillManager::load_bundled_skills\\` (\\`app/src/ai/skills/skill_manager.rs:421\\`) auto-discovers any directory under \\`resources/bundled/skills/\\` with a \\`SKILL.md\\`, and the default \\`BundledSkillActivation::Always\\` is appropriate since this skill doesn't depend on a bundled resource file.\n\n## Testing\n\nTested manually in a local \\`./script/run\\` build of the OSS channel against \\`~/.warp-oss/keybindings.yaml\\`:\n- _\"Please change ctrl+space mapping to ctrl+s\"_ → agent grepped the yaml, didn't find a match (default), and used \\`ask_user_question\\` to disambiguate the action instead of guessing. ✓\n- Direct rebinds by action name produced correctly-quoted entries with the right keystroke normalization (including \\`shift-A\\` casing). ✓\n- Multi-keystroke chords (\\`cmd-shift-D escape\\`) produced as expected. ✓\n- Removal via \\`none\\` sentinel applied correctly. ✓\n- After restarting Warp, the new bindings took effect, confirming the format the skill produces is one Warp's parser actually accepts.\n\nNo automated test added — the skill is a markdown content file with no executable surface beyond what the existing \\`read_bundled_skills\\` parser already covers, and behavior is LLM-driven.\n\n## Server API dependencies\n\nN/A — no server changes.\n\n## Agent Mode\n- [ ] Warp Agent Mode - This PR was created via Warp's AI Agent Mode\n\n## Changelog Entries for Stable\n\nCHANGELOG-IMPROVEMENT: Agent Mode can now help you remap Warp keyboard shortcuts — ask it to change a shortcut and it will edit your keybindings.yaml for you.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Warp <agent@warp.dev>","labels":[{"id":10812287780,"node_id":"LA_kwDOFua7Vs8AAAAChHZrJA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/warpdotdev/warp/labels/cla-signed","name":"cla-signed","description":null,"color":"ededed","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":10832499370,"node_id":"LA_kwDOFua7Vs8AAAACharSqg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/warpdotdev/warp/labels/external-contributor","name":"external-contributor","description":"Indicates that a PR has been opened by someone outside the Warp team.","color":"da7d83","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-04-29T13:05:10Z","updated_at":"2026-05-08T00:38:22Z","closed_at":"2026-05-08T00:38:22Z","merged_at":"2026-05-08T00:38:22Z","merge_commit_sha":"e773643569895ecefd60612647bbb1138d38c356","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"sebryu:sebryu/change-keybinding-skill","ref":"sebryu/change-keybinding-skill","repo":{"id":1223915646,"node_id":"R_kgDOSPN4fg","name":"warp","full_name":"sebryu/warp","owner":{"login":"sebryu","id":6872083,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4NzIwODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6872083?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebryu","html_url":"https://github.com/sebryu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebryu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebryu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://a